{"command": "node.create", "params": {"type": "text", "parent": {"$ref": "section_route"}, "text": "The loop climbs gently for the first three kilometres, then opens onto the ridge. Allow two and a half hours, more if you stop at the spring. The last stretch is exposed, so start before the afternoon wind.", "props": {"textStyle": "Body/L", "fill": {"$var": "text/secondary"}, "sizingH": "fill", "wrapStyle": "pretty"}}}
